<title>USA: WCI shareholder might take co private.</title>
<headline>WCI shareholder might take co private.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, Ohio 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>WCI Steel Inc said on Tuesday major shareholder The Renco Group Inc was considering making an offer to take the company private.</p>
<p>WCI, which said in a statement that it was considering financing alternatives, said Renco owned 84 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>If Renco decided to make an offer, it would do so within the next two weeks, depending on market conditions, WCI said.</p>
<p>WCI closed Tuesday at 5-5/8, off 1/8.</p>
</text>
